//0.7.5: a promoted constant default crosses the module boundary — the
//double literal 0.5 rides the DefaultValueDesc double channel, and the
//consumer's fill normalizes the staged slot to the float formal's kind
//(EmitScalarSlotCast in EmitBinding). Before the normalize the double's
//low bytes reached the callee as the float's bits.
int probe(float x = 0.5) {
    if (x == 0.5f) { return 33; }
    return 0;
}
